Troubleshooting Tips
Gobuster Issues:

If wordlists missing: sudo apt install wordlists or use custom lists
Connection refused: Verify Apache is running with sudo systemctl status apache2
Python Script Errors:

Import errors: Install missing libraries with pip3 install <library>
Permission denied: Use chmod +x to make scripts executable
Elasticsearch/Kibana Problems:

Services not starting: Check logs in /var/log/elasticsearch/ and /var/log/kibana/
Connection refused: Verify services running with systemctl status
Index not appearing: Wait 30-60 seconds after data generation
